        },
        {
          "id": "3678046",
          "text": "Certaines choses sont impossibles.",
          "translation": "Некоторые вещи невозможны.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #3678046 @sacredceltic / #14065126 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/3678046",
