          "id": "5619245",
          "text": "Ils méritent le respect.",
          "translation": "Они заслуживают уважения.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5619245 @Aiji / #4356542 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5619245",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "respect-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "10711043",
          "text": "Traite-les avec respect.",
          "translation": "Относись к ним с уважением.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10711043 @xhlulu / #11091594 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10711043",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
