          "text": "Mon tour viendra.",
          "translation": "Придёт мой черёд.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #14078592 @madjidoumnia / #14078614 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/14078592",
