          "id": "8676834",
          "text": "Soyez sur vos gardes !",
          "translation": "Будьте настороже!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #8676834 @Julien_PDC / #10139713 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/8676834",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gardes-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12116347",
          "text": "Tu gardes leurs secrets.",
          "translation": "Ты хранишь их секреты.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12116347 @LdjuherTaqvaylit / #12116355 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12116347",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "gardes-noun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13651648",
          "text": "Tu le gardes chez toi ?",
