          "text": "Mes forces sont épuisées.",
          "translation": "Мои силы иссякли.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #10457087 @felix63 / #5381912 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/10457087",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
