          "source": "Tatoeba #9598102 @Rafik / #10001326 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/9598102",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "prendra-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "13797506",
          "text": "Il prendra du pain.",
          "translation": "Он возьмёт хлеб.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #13797506 @slahatuvelli / #13797515 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/13797506",
