          "text": "Je vais lancer sur toi une malédiction.",
          "translation": "Я наложу на тебя проклятие.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1724396 @sacredceltic / #2004727 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1724396",
