          "word_slugs": [
            "man-symbol"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "4849065",
          "text": "Regarde M'man, je sais lire !",
          "translation": "Смотри, мам, я умею читать!",
          "source": "Tatoeba #4849065 @sicerabibax / #4849025 @odexed (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/4849065",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "man-symbol"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "397820",
          "text": "Spider-Man est cool. Mais les araignées... non, pas du tout.",
          "translation": "Человек-паук крутой. А пауки — нет.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #397820 @qdii / #397819 @FeuDRenais (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/397820",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "man-symbol"
          ]
        }
      ],
