          "id": "11268831",
          "text": "Cesse de rêver.",
          "translation": "Хватит мечтать.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #11268831 @LdjuherTaqvaylit / #6473869 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/11268831",
