          "text": "Qui devons-nous inviter ?",
          "translation": "Кого нам пригласить?",
          "source": "Tatoeba #1078282 @nimfeo / #4954652 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/1078282",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "inviter-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "12436860",
          "text": "Tu peux inviter tes amis.",
          "translation": "Можешь пригласить своих друзей.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #12436860 @LdjuherTaqvaylit / #12436862 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/12436860",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "inviter-verb"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "5344209",
          "text": "Tom aurait dû inviter Mary.",
          "translation": "Тому надо было пригласить Мэри.",
          "source": "Tatoeba #5344209 @Aiji / #4674441 @marafon (CC BY 2.0 FR) https://tatoeba.org/eng/sentences/show/5344209",
          "cefr_level": "A1",
          "word_slugs": [
            "inviter-verb"
          ]
        }
      ],
